    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d424-a1">

                <pb facs="0755" n="685" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg685"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dias Prieto to
                        Mr. Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States of Mexico</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Tombstone, Ariz.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1883-03-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 15, 1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to inform you that the Apaches continue to leave the San Carlos
                    Reservation for the State of Sonora one by one, two by two, and even in parties
                    of four. These Indians have recently appeared in considerable numbers in that
                    State and have committed various outrages* * * very near the aforesaid
                    reservation, without any measures having been taken to restrain them.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I renew, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>DIAZ PRIETO.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
